  patientDialogue: "Trong ng\u01B0\u1EDDi t\xF4i m\u1ECDc m\u1ED9t kh\u1ED1i u c\u1EE9ng
    ng\u1EAFc nh\u01B0 h\xF2n \u0111\xE1 b\xE1m s\xE2u v\xE0o th\u1ECBt, b\u1EC1
